Package: zujwt
Title: Sign, Verify, Encrypt and Decrypt JSON Web Tokens
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Signs, verifies, encrypts and decrypts JSON Object Signing and
    Encryption ('JOSE') objects: JSON Web Signatures (RFC 7515)
    <doi:10.17487/RFC7515>, JSON Web Encryption (RFC 7516)
    <doi:10.17487/RFC7516>, JSON Web Keys (RFC 7517)
    <doi:10.17487/RFC7517> and JSON Web Tokens (RFC 7519)
    <doi:10.17487/RFC7519>, in the compact and JSON serializations. The
    caller names the algorithms it accepts, and tokens are checked against
    the current best practices of RFC 8725 <doi:10.17487/RFC8725>. Written
    in R over 'zucrypt', so no system cryptography library is needed.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/pedrobtz/zujwt, https://pedrobtz.github.io/zujwt/
